<Project>

  <!-- Deliberately empty, and it must stay in place.

       MSBuild walks up from a project directory until it finds a
       Directory.Build.props, and after installation these projects sit inside
       the user's .claude - so without this file the walk would continue into
       their home directory and quietly pick up whatever build properties it
       found there. The generator would then build differently on their machine
       than it does here, for a reason nothing in the output would name.

       This stops the walk at the root of the installed payload (R-N4). -->

</Project>
